      "title": "may / might",
      "rule": "*may* va *might* — \"ehtimol, balki\": biror narsa boʻlishi mumkin, lekin aniq emas. Hamma shaxs uchun bir xil, keyin feʼlning asosiy shakli keladi: *It may rain tomorrow. Aziz might come later.* Inkor: *may not / might not*: *She may not come.* *May I…?* — muloyim ruxsat soʻrash: *May I open the window?* — *Yes, you may.*",
      "examples": [
        "It may rain tomorrow.",
        "Aziz might come to the party.",
        "Dilnoza may be at school.",
        "We might go to Samarkand next week.",
        "Bekzod might not come today.",
        "May I open the window?"
      ],
      "words": [
