        "en": "Dilnoza: What are you going to do at the weekend, Aziz?\nAziz: I don't know. I may go to Samarkand. My parents are there.\nDilnoza: And you, Malika?\nMalika: I might stay at home. It may rain on Saturday.\nAziz: Mr Kim might come to Usmat. He may visit our school.\nDilnoza: Great! May I come with you to Samarkand?\nAziz: Yes, of course!"
      },
